{"seq":1,"slug":"listing-delist-intransit-fulfill","title":"商品下架与在途订单履约责任","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-offboarding-store-closure/winddown-obligation/listing-delist-intransit-fulfill","wordCount":2308,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"商品下架与在途订单履约责任\">商品下架与在途订单履约责任</h1><p>平台运营最常犯的一个错误，是让&quot;关店&quot;这个动作同时完成两件本该分开的事：停止接受新订单，以及让所有商品页立刻消失。前一件是必须的，后一件在大多数情况下是有害的——因为商品页消失会让<strong>已下单的买家无法查看订单对应的商品详情</strong>，而商品详情恰恰是买家判断&quot;我收到的东西对不对&quot;、以及平台处理拒付时举证&quot;我交付了什么&quot;的关键证据。一个关机式的关店动作，会在两周后变成一批无法举证的拒付争议。</p>\n<p>正确的顺序是<strong>先停接单，再逐层下架，最后才关闭商品页的公开访问</strong>，并且下架的对象是&quot;商品的可售状态&quot;而非&quot;商品的记录&quot;。本文定义下架的三种语义、在途订单的履约责任划分、以及未交付订单的处置决策树。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"下架的三种语义\">下架的三种语义</h3><p>中文里的&quot;下架&quot;在工程上对应三种不同的动作，混用它们会直接导致数据错误：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>买家可见性</th>\n<th>可否恢复</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>停售（unlist）</td>\n<td>不再出现在搜索与列表，详情页仍可访问</td>\n<td>详情页可访问</td>\n<td>可</td>\n<td>关店收尾、类目整改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遮挡（delist）</td>\n<td>从公开访问移除，仅订单关联方可访问</td>\n<td>仅买家凭订单</td>\n<td>可</td>\n<td>退出生效后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归档（archive）</td>\n<td>从活跃数据集移除，转冷存储留存</td>\n<td>不可访问</td>\n<td>需申请</td>\n<td>责任保留期内</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键区别在第二与第三列。<strong>&quot;买家可见性&quot;决定了拒付举证能力，&quot;可否恢复&quot;决定了误操作的成本</strong>。把归档当成下架的默认行为，会在一次误触之后让一批历史商品详情永久不可恢复；而把所有下架都做成停售，则会让出售违规商品的商家在关店后仍可通过详情页继续展示商品。</p>\n<h3 id=\"在途订单的三段责任\">在途订单的三段责任</h3><p>在途订单（下单未签收）在商家退出时需要按履约进度分段处理，因为不同阶段的责任主体与可选动作不同：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单状态] --&gt; B{已支付?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[订单自然失效]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D{已发货?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[未发货段]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F{已签收?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[运输中段]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[已完成&lt;br/&gt;进入售后尾巴]&#10;  E --&gt; E1[商家: 继续发货]&#10;  E --&gt; E2[商家: 主动取消退款]&#10;  E --&gt; E3[超时: 平台代取消退款]&#10;  G --&gt; G1[继续运输至签收]&#10;  G --&gt; G2[拦截退回并退款]&#10;  G --&gt; G3[丢失/停滞: 平台先行退款]&#10;  H --&gt; I[见 售后未决与质保责任延续期]\">graph TD\n  A[订单状态] --&gt; B{已支付?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[订单自然失效]\n  B --&gt;|是| D{已发货?}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[未发货段]\n  D --&gt;|是| F{已签收?}\n  F --&gt;|否| G[运输中段]\n  F --&gt;|是| H[已完成&lt;br/&gt;进入售后尾巴]\n  E --&gt; E1[商家: 继续发货]\n  E --&gt; E2[商家: 主动取消退款]\n  E --&gt; E3[超时: 平台代取消退款]\n  G --&gt; G1[继续运输至签收]\n  G --&gt; G2[拦截退回并退款]\n  G --&gt; G3[丢失/停滞: 平台先行退款]\n  H --&gt; I[见 售后未决与质保责任延续期]</pre><p>三段的责任划分可以概括为一句话：<strong>未发货段平台有代取消的权力，运输中段平台有代垫付的义务，已完成段平台继承售后义务</strong>。这个划分的依据是控制力——未发货时平台能单方面终结交易，运输中时平台无法阻止交付但能对买家先行赔付，已完成时平台成为唯一可追索的对象。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么必须设-订单截止-独立时刻\">为什么必须设&quot;订单截止&quot;独立时刻</h3><p><code>order_cutoff_at</code>（停止接单时刻）必须早于退出生效时刻，且两者之差必须大于平均履约时长。设平均履约时长（下单到签收）为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其分布的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p95</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">95</span></span></span></span></span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>95</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{95}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则合理的约束是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>effective_at</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>order_cutoff_at</mtext><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>95</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{effective\\_at} - \\text{order\\_cutoff\\_at} \\ge L_{95} + \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">effective_at</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">order_cutoff_at</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p95</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">95</span></span></span></span></span> 而非均值，是因为退出场景下最怕的不是&quot;平均多等两天&quot;，而是&quot;有一小批订单卡在关店那一刻&quot;。取均值的后果是约一半的最后一分钟订单会跨过生效时刻，而它们正是最需要履约保障的那批。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 是操作缓冲，用于吸收履约异常与状态回传延迟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"下架的执行顺序\">下架的执行顺序</h2><h3 id=\"分类目而非全店一次性下架\">分类目而非全店一次性下架</h3><p>下架的正确粒度是&quot;按履约影响排序&quot;，而不是全店同时。可用的排序依据有三类：<strong>是否仍有在途订单</strong>（有在途的必须保持详情可访问）、<strong>是否属于争议高发类目</strong>（高争议类目应先行停售以减少新增纠纷）、<strong>是否为平台的战略类目</strong>（需要走额外的转移或清仓流程）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT l.category_id,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE o.order_id IS NOT NULL) AS in_transit_orders,&#10;       max(o.created_at)                              AS latest_order_at,&#10;       count(*)                                       AS listing_count&#10;  FROM merchant_listing l&#10;  LEFT JOIN order_item oi ON oi.listing_id = l.listing_id&#10;  LEFT JOIN orders o ON o.order_id = oi.order_id&#10;                    AND o.state IN (&#39;PAID&#39;,&#39;SHIPPED&#39;,&#39;IN_TRANSIT&#39;)&#10; WHERE l.merchant_id = $1 AND l.listing_state = &#39;ACTIVE&#39;&#10; GROUP BY l.category_id&#10; ORDER BY in_transit_orders DESC, latest_order_at DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_transit_orders,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> latest_order_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> listing_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merchant_listing l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_item oi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> oi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">listing_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">listing_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> oi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SHIPPED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'IN_TRANSIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">merchant_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">listing_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ACTIVE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_transit_orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, latest_order_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询的输出就是分批下架的队列：<code>in_transit_orders</code> 最大、<code>latest_order_at</code> 最新的类目最后下架，因为它们的详情页最需要保持可访问。用 <code>LEFT JOIN</code> 而非 <code>JOIN</code> 是必要的——没有任何在途订单的类目也必须出现在队列里（它们的 <code>in_transit_orders</code> 为 0，可立即下架），否则会出现&quot;卖不动品类的商品永远不下架&quot;的漏洞。</p>\n<h3 id=\"详情页的访问控制\">详情页的访问控制</h3><p>退出生效后，商品详情页不能直接返回 404，而应按访问者身份分派：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;resource&quot;: &quot;listing_detail&quot;,&#10;  &quot;listing_state&quot;: &quot;DELISTED&quot;,&#10;  &quot;access_rules&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;when&quot;: &quot;viewer_has_order_for_listing&quot;, &quot;result&quot;: &quot;FULL_DETAIL&quot;, &quot;note&quot;: &quot;保留完整详情以供买家核对与平台举证&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;when&quot;: &quot;viewer_is_merchant_owner&quot;, &quot;result&quot;: &quot;FULL_DETAIL&quot;, &quot;note&quot;: &quot;商家在导出窗口期内仍可导出&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;when&quot;: &quot;viewer_is_platform_ops&quot;, &quot;result&quot;: &quot;FULL_DETAIL&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;when&quot;: &quot;viewer_is_public&quot;, &quot;result&quot;: &quot;GONE_WITH_EXPLANATION&quot;, &quot;note&quot;: &quot;返回已下架说明，不返回 404&quot; }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"resource\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"listing_detail\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"listing_state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DELISTED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"access_rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"viewer_has_order_for_listing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FULL_DETAIL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"保留完整详情以供买家核对与平台举证\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"viewer_is_merchant_owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FULL_DETAIL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"商家在导出窗口期内仍可导出\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"viewer_is_platform_ops\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FULL_DETAIL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"viewer_is_public\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GONE_WITH_EXPLANATION\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"返回已下架说明，不返回 404\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>GONE_WITH_EXPLANATION</code> 这一条值得强调：对公众返回 404 会让爬虫与搜索引擎把该 URL 从索引中移除，这本身没有坏处；但对<strong>从订单页跳转过来的买家</strong>返回 404 是灾难性的——这正是&quot;买家已签收但认为收到的不是描述的商品&quot;这一拒付场景中最常见的争议点。所以判定必须优先看&quot;该访问者是否有此商品的订单&quot;，这个判断比商品状态本身更重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"未交付订单的决策树\">未交付订单的决策树</h2><h3 id=\"超时取消的时限设定\">超时取消的时限设定</h3><p>对于未发货订单，如果商家在退出流程中不主动处理，平台必须在某个时刻代为取消并退款。这个时刻的设定需要同时满足两个约束：<strong>不能早于商家仍有履约可能的时刻</strong>，也<strong>不能晚到买家已经丧失耐心的时刻</strong>。可参照的锚点是美国联邦贸易委员会对邮购/网络订单的规定——未载明发货时间时应在<strong>收到订单后 30 天内</strong>发货，超出必须主动告知并提供取消与退款选项（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/16/435.2\">16 CFR § 435.2</a>）。</p>\n<p>落到退出场景，合理的时限通常取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext>天</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>冷静期剩余</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mtext>天</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min(30\\text{天}, \\text{冷静期剩余} + 15\\text{天})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">天</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">冷静期剩余</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">天</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：前者是监管锚点，后者是退出流程的剩余时间。取最小值是因为退出场景有一条普通订单没有的紧迫性——<strong>商家可能随时失去响应能力</strong>（资金链断裂、法务介入、平台冻结），等待本身不产生任何履约进展。</p>\n<h3 id=\"平台代垫付的触发条件\">平台代垫付的触发条件</h3><p>运输中段的订单，平台有三种可能的动作：等待、拦截、代垫付。触发代垫付的条件应当是<strong>可观测的履约停滞</strong>，而不是固定的等待时长：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>物流轨迹连续 N 天无更新（N 按渠道差异设定，跨境通常显著大于境内）；</li>\n<li>承运商明确返回异常状态（丢失、退回、清关滞留超期）；</li>\n<li>商家侧已进入退出流程且无法联系。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三种条件都应触发同一条动作：<strong>平台先行向买家退款，再以债权人对商家主张</strong>。这是&quot;消费者优先&quot;原则在退出场景的具体形式，其背后的资金机制（准备金如何覆盖这笔代垫、代垫后如何从商家余额或保证金中回收）见 <a href=\"deposit-protection-reserve-hold\">保证金、买家保障准备金与暂扣释放</a>，以及更下游的 <a href=\"../final-settlement-tax/bankrupt-unreachable-compensation\">破产/失联商家的平台代偿与追偿</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"主动取消与买家选择的边界\">主动取消与买家选择的边界</h3><p>取消订单不是平台的单方面权力，它需要区分两种情形：<strong>商家主动取消</strong>（商家决定不发货，退款即可，但影响其履约率指标）与<strong>平台代取消</strong>（商家失能，平台代为终结交易）。两者的数据记录必须分开，因为它们对商家信用记录与再入驻判定的影响不同——被平台代取消的记录会进入 <a href=\"../data-release-lifecycle/reactivation-readmission-rule\">关店复活、再入驻限制与退出度量</a> 的度量体系，而商家主动取消则更多反映为履约能力信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>&quot;下架&quot;有三种语义——停售（详情页仍可访问）、遮挡（仅订单关联方可见）、归档（转冷存储）——它们的买家可见性与可恢复性不同，混用会造成举证能力丢失或误操作不可逆。</li>\n<li>下架必须<strong>先停接单再逐层下架</strong>，且商品详情页的访问控制要按访问者身份分派；对<strong>有订单的买家返回 404</strong> 是拒付争议中最常见的举证缺口，必须返回完整详情。</li>\n<li>在途订单按履约进度分三段：未发货段平台有代取消权，运输中段平台有代垫付义务，已完成段平台继承售后义务。</li>\n<li>订单截止时刻与退出生效时刻之差应大于平均履约时长的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p95</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">95</span></span></span></span></span> 而非均值，否则最后一分钟的订单会跨过生效时刻。</li>\n<li>下架粒度按类目分批，排序依据是&quot;在途订单数&quot;与&quot;最近下单时间&quot;，用 <code>LEFT JOIN</code> 确保无在途订单的类目也进入队列。</li>\n<li>未发货订单的超时时限可取&quot;监管锚点（未载明时的 30 天，<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/16/435.2\">16 CFR § 435.2</a>）&quot;与&quot;退出流程剩余时间&quot;的较小值，因为退出场景中商家可能随时失去响应能力。</li>\n<li>代垫付应由<strong>可观测的履约停滞</strong>触发（轨迹停滞、承运商异常、商家失联），并区分商家主动取消与平台代取消，因为二者对再入驻判定的影响不同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"商品下架与在途订单履约责任","id":"商品下架与在途订单履约责任"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"下架的三种语义","id":"下架的三种语义"},{"level":3,"text":"在途订单的三段责任","id":"在途订单的三段责任"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么必须设\"订单截止\"独立时刻","id":"为什么必须设-订单截止-独立时刻"},{"level":2,"text":"下架的执行顺序","id":"下架的执行顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"分类目而非全店一次性下架","id":"分类目而非全店一次性下架"},{"level":3,"text":"详情页的访问控制","id":"详情页的访问控制"},{"level":2,"text":"未交付订单的决策树","id":"未交付订单的决策树"},{"level":3,"text":"超时取消的时限设定","id":"超时取消的时限设定"},{"level":3,"text":"平台代垫付的触发条件","id":"平台代垫付的触发条件"},{"level":3,"text":"主动取消与买家选择的边界","id":"主动取消与买家选择的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"买家告知与收尾窗口期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-offboarding-store-closure/closure-type-request/buyer-notification-winddown-window"},"next":{"title":"售后未决与质保责任延续期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-offboarding-store-closure/winddown-obligation/aftersales-warranty-tail-obligation"}}